Package: kundy
Architecture: any
Depends: bash, passwd, systemd, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: pishoo, gmutils
Description: local appliance initialization service
 Kundy is the local initialization and lifecycle service for a Genmeta
 appliance. It provides the local DHTTP setup page, activation workflow, and
 the fixed host integration protocol used by the appliance runtime.
